(Analyses based on multiple imputations assuming data were missing at random resulted in) Tj T*
(a pooled odds ratio estimate of 1.66 \(95% CI 0.77, 3.59, p?=?0.19\). Analyses based on) Tj T*
(multiple imputations assuming data were missing at random, using the delta method,) Tj T*
