() Tj T*
(Secondary outcomes) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Results of secondary outcomes are shown in Table 2. Using a continuous frailty score,) Tj T*
(HIW participants had a mean change of ?1.51 \(SD: 1.18\) points compared with ?1.19 \(SD:) Tj T*
