(analyses.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Adverse events) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(There was one definitely related adverse event in the HIW group; a non-injurious fall.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(There were 13 serious adverse events \(9 in CSW, 4 in HIW\); all unrelated to the) Tj T*
(intervention. There were 2 probably \(2 in CSW\) and 7 possibly \(3 in CSW, 4 in HIW\)) Tj T*
(related adverse events. Probably related events were: one instance of knee pain and one) Tj T*
