() Tj T*
(Discussion) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(This is the first study to demonstrate that HIW can reverse frailty in older adults with) Tj T*
(frailty. After 16 weeks, HIW participants had significantly higher odds of improving at) Tj T*
(least one SHARE-FI frailty category compared to CSW participants. Numerous prior studies) Tj T*
(have investigated physical activity, multicomponent training, resistance exercise, and) Tj T*
(nutrition3,9 to improve capacity and physical function, rather than directly modifying) Tj T*
(the frailty syndrome. In a systematic review of 26 PA intervention studies for frailty,) Tj T*
(only one study used an aerobic intervention, and this study did not measure frailty as a) Tj T*
(primary outcome. [25]. In studies that have used frailty as a primary outcome, minimal) Tj T*
(benefit has been found. Huang et. al, found a 0.02 reduction in frailty index after 26) Tj T*
(weeks of training twice-weekly at 70% of heart rate reserve, which did not meet the 0.03) Tj T*
