() Tj T*
(This study is one of the first investigations in retirement communities targeting) Tj T*
(changes in physical frailty classification among the pre-frail and frail. This study was) Tj T*
(robustly designed with participants and assessors masked to group assignment, had good) Tj T*
(intervention adherence, and was feasible and safe among a vulnerable group of retirement) Tj T*
(community residents. Contrary to the view that exercise can counteract frailty-related) Tj T*
(physical impairments but not frailty itself, our findings show that frailty category can) Tj T*
(be reversed in older adults through a three time per week, 45-minute, 16 week walking) Tj T*
(intervention that stressed walking as fast as one can and resulted in approximately 70%) Tj T*
(HRmax. Our findings suggest increasing intervention intensity is a critical exercise) Tj T*
(parameter for those delivering exercise programs in clinical practice or in community-) Tj T*
(based interventions.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Supporting information) Tj T*
() Tj T*
